 "description": "The Look-aside Cryptography and Compression Engine (LCE) module is comprised of a sub-chip cryptographic subsystem in the Google IN763 SoC. The module provides lookaside cryptography services including bulk encryption, cryptographic hashing, Integrity Checksum Value (ICV) verification, and compression services. The module also supports operation chaining including cryptographic and pipeline compressing/decompressing and verification as well as standalone or combined DMA data (payload) transfers between nodes.",
